-- FINDING 4 (loud).  `EVAL AS OF SYSTEM TIME` takes a DATE, not a DATETIME.  The Gazette gives the
-- publication of S 549/2012 as 5.00 pm on 31 October 2012; no pin can say "5.00 pm".
-- Printed: an error, "The first input of function `EVAL AS OF SYSTEM TIME` ... is expected to be of type DATE".
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT datetime
TIMEZONE IS "Asia/Singapore"

`the Gazette instant` MEANS Datetime (Date 31 10 2012) 17 0 0

#EVAL `EVAL AS OF SYSTEM TIME` `the Gazette instant` TODAY
